    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1704" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄεπτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕπομαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
